# A2 — weak randomness (CWE-330, VYQL-CRY-003). A PRESENCE rule on the non-crypto `random`
# module / Math.random; a CSPRNG (secrets / os.urandom / crypto.randomBytes) is clean.

test "weak-random: random.randint is flagged (python)"
  lang python
  expect VYQL-CRY-003
  code
  ```
  import random
  token = random.randint(0, 999999)
  ```

test "weak-random: random.getrandbits is flagged (python)"
  lang python
  expect VYQL-CRY-003
  code
  ```
  import random
  secret = str(random.getrandbits(64))
  ```

test "weak-random: Math.random is flagged (javascript)"
  lang javascript
  expect VYQL-CRY-003
  code
  ```
  const token = Math.random().toString(36);
  ```

test "weak-random: a CSPRNG (secrets) is clean (python)"
  lang python
  reject VYQL-CRY-003
  code
  ```
  import secrets
  token = secrets.token_hex(16)
  ```
